	"Description": "Change your interface's clock to look a bit fancier, with lots of variations to switch between!\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />- - -\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[u]Notes[/u]\n<br />\n<br />This mod comes in two versions: [u]Bordered[/u] and [u]Vanilla[/u]. You'll only need to download one for it to work! In either version, you can change between clock styles in the config.\n<br />\n<br />- - -\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[u]Updates..?\n<br />[/u]\n<br />1.0.0 has 12 styles (6 for Vanilla), but I have more ideas -- including compatibility with interface mods. If you have any suggestions (or just want to criticize my pixel art), feel free to leave a comment!",
